acceptance_criteria: "Exact CLI2026.10.4 and latest pm-ops/pm-changelog/fleet pins, all devDependencies exact; absorb every pending dependency/workflow bump; full unchanged CI gate, strict pinned health, both audits clean, copied real-tracker packed npm/nativeBun acceptance, read-only managed pm-github preview; retain independent whole-source/privacy/hosted/reviewer boundaries and keep item open for orchestrator verification."
actual_result: "Full linked release:check411/411, zero skips; duplicate0/40537lines/142sources; coverage84.49/80.60/77.82 over32configuredfiles, statementsunmeasured. Canonical launcher7/7, workflow/catalog15/15 andlinkedscoped22/22; test-first actualCLI childinitializationregression1/1 preservesancestorbytes. Clean npmci+Buninstall/freshbuild pass; npm/nativeBun tarballdoctor/start/status/stop+authenticatedboard/export/graph all132realitems, completeexportdeep-equality andtrackerbytespreserved, scratch+PGstopped/deleted. Stricthealth0 with2stale advisoryitems; prod audit0/fullaudit4high blockedxucb; GitHubreadonlypreviewzerochanges; reviews pending."
